cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, cite the repository and the commit used."
title: "Generalized equipartition theorem in Lean"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
authors:
  - name: N-Y-L
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/N-Y-L/generalized-equipartition-lean"
abstract: >-
  Lean 4 formalization of generalized canonical equipartition for
  differentiable Hamiltonians on finite-dimensional Cartesian phase space.
  The proof derives coordinate integration by parts under explicit
  integrability and boundary hypotheses, constructs a Gibbs probability
  measure, and includes a fully discharged quadratic example.
